<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Let me at Thy throne of mercy</l><l>Find a sweet relief;</l><l>Kneeling there in deep contrition,</l><l>Help my unbelief.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Trusting only in Thy merit,</l><l>Would I seek Thy face;</l><l>Heal my wounded, broken spirit,</l><l>Save me by Thy grace.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thou the spring of all my comfort,</l><l>More than life to me;</l><l>Whom have I on earth beside Thee?</l><l>Whom in heaven but Thee?</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
